; smallparty.eval - parties of one, three and two, in play
; (docs/party-creation-plan.md, phase 2).
;
; Every other suite plays the default four. Party creation lets the player
; build fewer, and the rules that place a member are all BY ROSTER SLOT
; (0 front-left, 1 front-right, 2 rear-left, 3 rear-right), so a short party
; is a formation with holes in it. This walks each hole through the rules that
; read the formation:
;   - melee FROM AHEAD, the party swinging back (autoattack);
;   - melee FROM BEHIND with the party standing still, which shows the per-file
;     blocking rule: a missing near member OPENS its file, so the member behind
;     the hole is reachable. WHO IS HURT is the measurement:
;       one   - Brand (no rear rank at all);
;       three - Maren (slot 2, near in her file) and Sera (slot 1, whose rear
;               is the hole), never Brand (Maren shields him);
;       two   - both (no rear rank);
;   - an archer's bolts down the quadrant lanes;
;   - the leader's throw, and spells from either rank (autocast);
;   - the rear-rank reach rule (slot 2 never swings at what is ahead);
;   - a rest to recover, in a cleared room.
;
; Two harness facts shape the script. AUTOATTACK SWINGS BETWEEN COMMANDS (its
; cooldowns are not dt), so it goes on only after `tally reset` and off at the
; end of each section, or the tally misses the fight. And it TURNS TO THE
; THREAT, so a test of who a monster can reach from behind runs without it.
;
; `newparty` starts a NEW GAME with the party it builds, so the harness knobs
; (timescale, lockstep, seed) are set after it, each time. The numbers are
; measurements, not verdicts.

logecho on
reset

; ============ ONE: Brand alone (front-left, the other three slots empty) ====
newparty premade=0
roster
timescale 0
lockstep on
seed 11

heal
arena open 9 9
spawn skeleton 14 11 south
tp 14 12
face n
tally reset
autoattack on
step 20
autoattack off
echo === SOLO: a skeleton ahead ===
party
monsters
tally

heal
arena open 9 9
spawn skeleton 14 13 north 0.5
tp 14 12
face n
tally reset
step 6
echo === SOLO: a skeleton behind, nobody swinging ===
party
tally

heal
arena open 9 9
spawn skel_archer 14 8 south 0.3
tp 14 12
face n
tally reset
step 6
echo === SOLO: an archer ahead ===
party
tally

heal
arena open 9 9
spawn skeleton 14 9 south 0.3
tp 14 12
face n
give rock 0
tally reset
throw rock
step 3
echo === SOLO: a thrown rock ===
monsters
tally

arena open 9 9
tp 14 12
rest until 600
echo === SOLO: rested ===
party
state

; ============ THREE: Brand, Sera, Maren (rear-right empty) ==================
newparty premade=0 | premade=1 | premade=2
roster
timescale 0
lockstep on
seed 11

heal
arena open 9 9
spawn skeleton 14 11 south
tp 14 12
face n
tally reset
autoattack on
step 20
autoattack off
echo === THREE: a skeleton ahead ===
party
monsters
tally

; A target four squares off: the bolts land before it arrives.
heal
arena open 9 9
spawn skeleton 14 8 south
tp 14 12
face n
tally reset
autocast 2 flame 0.5
step 2
autocast off
echo === THREE: Maren casts from the rear rank ===
party
monsters
tally

heal
arena open 9 9
spawn skeleton 14 13 north 0.5
tp 14 12
face n
tally reset
step 6
echo === THREE: a skeleton behind, nobody swinging ===
party
tally

heal
arena open 9 9
spawn skel_archer 14 8 south 0.3
tp 14 12
face n
tally reset
step 6
echo === THREE: an archer ahead ===
party
tally

; No heal here: the archer's wounds are what the rest below recovers.
arena open 9 9
spawn skeleton 14 11 south
tp 14 12
face n
tally reset
swing 2
echo === THREE: Maren swings from the rear rank ===
tally

arena open 9 9
tp 14 12
rest until 600
echo === THREE: rested ===
party
state

; ============ TWO: a created orc and Maren, both front ======================
newparty name=Grak race=orc portrait=portrait010 color=60a040 points=2,0,3,0,0 skills=blunt,conditioning items=club,padded_jack | premade=2
roster
timescale 0
lockstep on
seed 11

heal
arena open 9 9
spawn skeleton 14 11 south
tp 14 12
face n
tally reset
autoattack on
step 20
autoattack off
echo === TWO: a skeleton ahead ===
party
monsters
tally

heal
arena open 9 9
spawn skeleton 14 8 south
tp 14 12
face n
tally reset
autocast 1 flame 0.5
step 2
autocast off
echo === TWO: Maren casts from the front rank ===
party
monsters
tally

heal
arena open 9 9
spawn skeleton 14 13 north 0.5
tp 14 12
face n
tally reset
step 6
echo === TWO: a skeleton behind, nobody swinging ===
party
tally

arena open 9 9
tp 14 12
rest until 600
echo === TWO: rested ===
party
state
